# ==========================================
# 6. FIRMWARE BUILD ARTIFACTS & HEAVY REFERENCE
# ==========================================
# CubeIDE build output for the steering-wheel firmware (keep the source under Core/)
steeringwheel-STeeringV3/Debug/
steeringwheel-STeeringV3/Release/
# Auto-generated HAL/CMSIS driver tree (~50 MB, regenerable by CubeMX) — keep Core/
steeringwheel-STeeringV3/Drivers/
# Keil MDK build output (compiled binaries / dep files) — keep the .uvprojx/.ioc
steeringwheel-STeeringV3/MDK-ARM/SteeringTest/
steeringwheel-STeeringV3/MDK-ARM/DebugConfig/
steeringwheel-STeeringV3/MDK-ARM/RTE/
*.elf
*.map
*.list
# 79 MB STM32 reference dump (contains its own nested .git) — not part of the app
Sources for CAN frame extraction/